Package: upsis
Title: Update 'brms' Models with Pareto-Smoothed Importance Sampling
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jacob B.", "Socolar", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Update fitted 'brms' models with modest additions or removals of
    data using Pareto-smoothed importance sampling. The package computes
    likelihood changes for the requested data update, smooths the resulting
    importance weights, and resamples posterior draws back into the fitted
    model object for use with standard 'brms' post-processing tools.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    assertthat,
    brms,
    loo,
    posterior
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
